msgid "VE／ZG MII 与 ZG RMII、独立 MDIO；raw `eth` 与增强 `eth_frames` 分选。增强 face 提供整帧 SG、单 C-tag VLAN、显式 checksum offload 和 MAC 硬件事件／PTP 时间戳；PHY 接线、协议栈、同步与网络政策由外部提供"
msgstr "VE/ZG MII and ZG RMII with separate MDIO; raw `eth` and enhanced `eth_frames` are selected separately. The enhanced face provides complete-frame SG, one C-tag VLAN, explicit checksum offload and MAC hardware-event/PTP timestamps; PHY wiring, protocol stacks, synchronization and network policy remain external"

