msgid "ILI9341 parallel16、XPT2046、W25 等通过公共端口访问；板级供电、存储分区和恢复政策由外部工程提供"
msgstr "ILI9341 parallel16, XPT2046, W25 and other components use public ports; Board power, storage partitions and recovery policy remain external"

msgid "[组件入口](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/README.md)、[I/O 所有权](../design/io-evolution.md)"
msgstr "[Components](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/components/README.md), [I/O ownership](../design/io-evolution.md)"

msgid "模式矩阵不穷举所有芯片功能的笛卡尔组合。未列出的格式、外部触发、共享资源和 后端组合必须由相应 provider 明确接入；不能从一种模式或公共 API 的存在推定。"
msgstr "The mode matrix does not enumerate every Cartesian combination of chip functions. Unlisted formats, external triggers, shared resources and backend combinations require explicit provider integration; support cannot be inferred from one mode or a public API."

msgid "选择、证据与来源"
msgstr "Selection, evidence and sources"

msgid "先确定精确型号和 Board 授权，再选择模式并通过 resolver 检查资源、内存域和时钟。 [派生能力表](capabilities.md)用于追踪声明、路线、装配和生产 ops；它不是第二份 配置输入，也不证明相关运行、排空或物理时序已通过。"
msgstr "Establish the exact part and Board authorization, then select a mode and pass the resolver's resource, memory-domain and clock checks. The [derived capability table](capabilities.md) traces declarations, routes, assemblies and production operations. It is neither a second configuration input nor proof that the corresponding execution, drain or physical timing passed."

msgid "源码维护、分组模型回归、ARM ELF、Source SDK、完整软件候选和物理 station 分别 建立证据，并绑定各自源码与配置。代理的 GREEN 或单个 ELF 不构成全候选通过。 当前 physical HIL 为 `not_executed`；未知 PCB、晶振精度、跳线、负载和波形保持未知。"
msgstr "Source maintenance, grouped model regressions, ARM ELF, Source SDK, whole software candidates and physical stations establish separate evidence bound to their own source and configuration. An agent's GREEN or a single ELF does not establish whole-candidate acceptance. Current physical HIL is `not_executed`; unknown PCBs, oscillator accuracy, jumpers, loads and waveforms remain unknown."

msgid "所有 vendor、子模块、锁与许可证保留。未选 SDK 不进入默认生产构建闭包； [器件目录](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/devices.json)只描述官方宏、启动和 IRQ 编译事实。 历史范围见[固定重构前源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18)， 旧候选、计数和实板结果不重标为当前源码资格。"
msgstr "All vendors, submodules, locks and licenses are retained. Unselected SDKs do not enter the default production build closure. The [device catalogue](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/devices.json) describes official macro, startup and IRQ compilation facts only. Historical scope is available in the [fixed pre-refactor source](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18); old candidates, counts and physical results are not relabeled as qualification for the current source."

msgid "FS／HS 引擎的 Device／Host、PIO 与 HS AHB DMA；Device 支持 control、bulk、interrupt 和单 transaction ISO packet。Device ISO 使用实际速度的帧窗口，接纳时剩余期限至多 1 秒，并满足受审 FIFO 分区；无 ACK／自动重试或周期调度。内部 PHY 仍为 FS，外部 ULPI 提供 HS／FS 回退；显式 managed roles 与按需 ST 官方 Core 桥接。不维护高带宽 ISO、remote wake、自动 HNP／SRP、Host split 或即时 premature STATUS OUT"
msgstr "Device/Host on FS/HS engines, PIO and HS AHB DMA. Device supports control, bulk, interrupt and single-transaction ISO packets. Device ISO uses the frame window for the observed speed, requires at most 1 second of remaining deadline on admission, and must fit the reviewed FIFO partition. It provides no ACK, automatic retry or periodic scheduling. The internal PHY remains FS; external ULPI provides HS/FS fallback. Explicit managed roles and optional ST Core bridges are available. High-bandwidth ISO, remote wake, automatic HNP/SRP, Host split and immediate premature STATUS OUT are not maintained"

msgid "SD memory／MMC polling、有限 IRQ／DMA；SDIO functions 使用独立 face 的 CMD5／52／53。单卡、3.3 V，SD／SDIO 为 1／4 位，MMC 可显式选择经版本和 SWITCH 检查的 8 位十引脚软件参考。combo 不同时维护 memory portion；当前只接纳 `hse8-pll168`，不提供 HS／DDR／HS200"
msgstr "SD memory / MMC polling and finite IRQ / DMA; SDIO functions use CMD5 / 52 / 53 through a separate face. One card, 3.3 V; SD / SDIO use 1 / 4-bit buses. MMC may explicitly select an 8-bit ten-pad software reference after version and SWITCH checks. Combo cards do not simultaneously maintain the memory portion. Only `hse8-pll168` is currently admitted; HS / DDR / HS200 are not provided"

msgid "已审 TIM3／4／5／9–14 PWM；TIM1／3／4／5／8／9–14 原始输入捕获，按实例开放 1／2／4 通道，TIM5 保留 32 位；TIM1／3／4／5／8 支持 x2／x4 正交计数。TIM2 保留给 Core，TIM6／7 用作专用触发；timer personality 独占，IRQ 只取得所选模式实际使用的向量"
msgstr "Reviewed TIM3 / 4 / 5 / 9–14 PWM; TIM1 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 8 / 9–14 raw input capture, with 1 / 2 / 4 channels according to the instance and a full 32-bit count on TIM5. TIM1 / 3 / 4 / 5 / 8 support x2 / x4 quadrature counting. TIM2 is reserved for Core and TIM6 / 7 for dedicated triggers. Timer personalities are exclusive; an IRQ lease covers only the vector actually used by the selected mode"

msgid "精确封装全部 GPIO 的 input／output、四档显式输出速度与 EXTI0–15；PVD 原始电平／事件。省略速度保留已有配置，PC13–15 输出限制为 LOW；晶振和调试引脚仍受资源约束。保留 COALESCED／LOSS，不提供自动消抖、精确边沿时间或 BOR 资格"
msgstr "Input / output on every GPIO pad of the exact packages, four explicit output-speed grades and EXTI0–15; raw PVD levels / events. An omitted speed preserves the existing setting, except PC13–15 outputs are restricted to LOW. Oscillator and debug pads remain subject to resource constraints. COALESCED / LOSS are preserved; no automatic debounce, exact edge time or BOR qualification"
